Cancellation:

* removes blessings and curses.
* blanks scrolls and books (except the Book of the Dead).
* turns most potions to undiluted water.  Sickness and see invisible
  become fruit juice.  Oil is unaffected.
* sets the spe of weapons, armour, weapon-tools, and non-wand objects
  of magical types (e.g. rings of gain/increase foo, magic markers)
  to 0.
* sets the spe of wands to -1.
